  <para xml:id="p1">
    <listing>
      <listingline labels="LABEL:line:standalone" xml:id="algx1.l1"><tags>
          <tag><text fontsize="80%">1:</text></tag>
          <tag role="refnum">1</tag>
        </tags><Math mode="inline" tex="x\leftarrow 42" text="x leftarrow 42" xml:id="algx1.l1.m1">
          <XMath>
            <XMApp>
              <XMTok name="leftarrow" role="ARROW">←</XMTok>
              <XMTok font="italic" role="UNKNOWN">x</XMTok>
              <XMTok meaning="42" role="NUMBER">42</XMTok>
            </XMApp>
          </XMath>
        </Math>
</listingline>
    </listing>
  </para>
  <para xml:id="p2">
    <p>In Algorithm <ref labelref="LABEL:alg:binsearch"/>, line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:req"/> states inputs and line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:ens"/> states outputs.
Initialization occurs at lines <ref labelref="LABEL:line:initl"/> and <ref labelref="LABEL:line:initr"/>.
The loop at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:while"/> computes the midpoint at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:mid"/>.
The match condition is checked at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:if"/>, returning at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:retm"/>.
Branching continues at lines <ref labelref="LABEL:line:elsif"/>, <ref labelref="LABEL:line:right"/>, <ref labelref="LABEL:line:else"/>, and <ref labelref="LABEL:line:left"/>.
The loop terminates at line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:endwhile"/>, falling through to line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:retfail"/>.
Referenced hierarchically: <ref labelref="LABEL:alg:binsearch"/>.<ref labelref="LABEL:line:mid"/>.
Standalone line <ref labelref="LABEL:line:standalone"/> sits outside any float.</p>
  </para>
